{"_v":1,"id":"witness-for-the-prosecution-west-end-2022","cat":"off-west-end","cs":70.56,"rc":11,"bd":{"positive":6,"mixed":4,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Marianka Swain","o":"The Telegraph","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/witness-for-the-prosecution-county-hall-review/","d":"2023-07-21","q":"Combined with Bailey’s inspired use of an historic location, it’s criminally entertaining."},{"cn":"Will Longman","o":"London Theatre","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/review-agatha-christies-witness-for-the-prosecution-at-london-county-hall","q":"It feels like an almost pantomimic finale to what is until then a slow-burning thriller."},{"cn":"Sarah Hemming","o":"Financial Times","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/e10b1230-b8cf-11e7-8c12-5661783e5589","d":"2017-10-24","q":"Still, roll with it and it is delightfully entertaining — rather aptly, a guilty pleasure."},{"cn":"David Benedict","o":"The Stage","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/long-reviews/witness-for-the-prosecution-county-hall-london-agatha-christie-eleanor-lloyd","d":"2021-09-30","q":"But once exposition is dealt with, the twisty tale takes wing."},{"cn":"Theo Bosanquet","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/london-theatre/reviews/witness-for-the-prosecution-at-london-county-hall_55027.html","d":"2021-10-01"},{"cn":"Olivia Garrett","o":"Radio Times","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.radiotimes.com/going-out/going-out-reviews/witness-for-the-prosecution-review/","d":"2024-01-18","q":"Witness for the Prosecution is a spine-tingling and mesmerising watch which messes with your mind perfectly."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"West End Wilma","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://westendwilma.com/review-witness-for-the-prosecution-london-2022/","d":"2022-10-13","q":"As Leonard Vole, Harry Reid is a tour de force able to draw the audience’s heart strings."},{"cn":"Miriam Gibson","o":"London Box Office","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/review-wftp","d":"2022-05-03","q":"It’s difficult to imagine how anybody could not enjoy this play."},{"cn":"Emma Watkins","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/westend/article/BWW-Review-WITNESS-FOR-THE-PROSECUTION-London-County-Hall-20220428","d":"2022-04-28","q":"You might find you change your mind about that - maybe even more than once - but one thing's for sure: you'll be glad you came."},{"cn":"Mary Pollard","o":"Everything Theatre","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://everything-theatre.co.uk/2022/04/review-witness-for-the-prosecution-london-county-hall/","d":"2022-04-29","q":"This production is enormously impressive, offering a classic thriller in an extraordinary setting that elevates the play beyond its already superb script."},{"cn":"Amy Rye","o":"Lost in Theatreland","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://lostintheatreland.co.uk/review-witness-for-the-prosecution-london-county-hall/","d":"2022-10-09","q":"This is one of the most unique theatrical experiences available right now, and you will not be disappointed."}],"au":{"score":92.37,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"ss":{"s":92,"c":844},"mz":{"s":81,"c":841,"sr":4.1},"rd":{"s":82,"c":42,"tp":29,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.02,"positive":0.76,"mixed":0.12,"negative":0.07,"neutral":0.02}},"sp":{"s":94,"c":1205,"sr":4.71},"ltd":{"s":95,"c":2821,"sr":4.8},"lb":{"s":94,"c":297,"sr":4.7}}},"hi":"/images/shows/witness-for-the-prosecution-west-end-2022/hero.webp","pd":"2017-10-23"}